info = "In [i]Stellar Cartographer[/i], all star systems have [color=yellow]three wormholes[/color]. You enter through one and have two options for traversal. Traversing a wormhole requires interacting with it.

'GO-TO' and traverse Peregrination or Odyssey to begin your journey to New Eden.
[img]res://graphics/system-map/actions-panel/go_to_icon.png[/img]
View more information in the OBJECTIVES LIST."
